# CASM Phase 14 WP89 trusted reference: casmloc1
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmloc1 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves a
# @local label resolves as a backward branch target within its scope.
#
# Source (.ORG $C000, fixed address):
#   | .ORG $C000
#   | MAIN:
#   | @LOOP:
#   |     NOP
#   |     BNE @LOOP
#
# Hand assembly:
#   00 C0    - PRG load-address header ($C000, little-endian)
#   EA       - @LOOP NOP at $C000
#   D0 FD    - BNE @LOOP at $C001; displacement $C000 - $C003 = -3 = $FD
#
# bytes: 5

00 C0
EA
D0 FD
